OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785757675
OL,3,C'Trespassing' tortoise saved from
OL,4,Crailway line
OL,6,FA 50-year-old "trespassing" tortoise
OL,7,Fthat brought a major UK train line to
OL,8,Fa complete standstill by wandering
OL,9,Fonto the tracks has been reunited with
OL,10,Fits owner.
OL,12,FThe adventurous reptile was spotted
OL,13,Fmaking slow and steady progress along
OL,14,Fthe West Coast mainline by a passenger
OL,15,Fwho was waiting on the platform at
OL,16,FRuncorn station.
OL,18,FAfter the tortoise was reported to
OL,19,FAvanti West Coast, station staff
OL,20,Fworked alongside Network Rail to
OL,21,Farrange a safe rescue.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
