FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785757675
OL,3,C'Trespassing' tortoise saved from
OL,4,Crailway line
OL,6,FTrains travelling through the railway
OL,7,Fstation in Cheshire were temporarily
OL,8,Fpaused while the pet was escorted away
OL,9,Ffrom danger.
OL,11,FThe tortoise was taken to a local
OL,12,Frescue centre where it was cared for
OL,13,Fovernight, before being reunited with
OL,14,Fits owner - bringing a happy ending to
OL,15,Fa "shell-shocking" incident.
OL,17,FKathryn O'Brien, from Avanti West
OL,18,FCoast, praised the quick response from
OL,19,Frailway staff.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785757675
OL,3,C'Trespassing' tortoise saved from
OL,4,Crailway line
OL,6,FShe said: "We're proud of the team's
OL,7,Fswift actions, which helped bring the
OL,8,Ftortoise to safety while keeping
OL,9,Fdisruption to customers' journeys to a
OL,10,Fminimum."
OL,12,FRoss Davies, from Network Rail, said:
OL,13,F"While there was initial shell shock
OL,14,Fin our control room when we first got
OL,15,Fthe call about a trespassing tortoise,
OL,16,Fthere was nothing slow and steady with
OL,17,Four response during our joint race
OL,18,Fwith Avanti to make this highly
OL,19,Funusual reptile rescue.
OL,26,@nD@KOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
