OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785757675
OL,3,C'Trespassing' tortoise saved from
OL,4,Crailway line
OL,6,F"Thankfully trains were only stopped
OL,7,Ffor 10 minutes so passengers could
OL,8,Fhare it to their destinations, and
OL,9,Fit's cracking to know this plucky pet
OL,10,Fis now safe and sound back with its
OL,11,Fowner after its brush with danger on
OL,12,Fthe West Coast Main Line."
OL,26,@tD@ZO]
